  "summary": "Convertible (19467) with the C07 auxiliary removable hardtop: how the hardtop (roof asm.) is attached to the car - the rear hold-down stud and housing at the body, the front header locks (RH lock and LH/center locks, with lock housings) and the header guides (guide pins). The rear stud goes through the body panel with a press-fit spacer, a hose sleeve, washer, lock washer and nut; the locks bolt to the roof from the side, and the guides are screwed up into the roof. Locks are adjusted for a 13-16 lb release load at the back edge of the paddles.",
